* exiting

plus the minimum timer needed for the transition.

The exact representation is up to the implementation, but it must be deterministic and carried by every racer object just as Neela/Lolanthe/Verdant state is.

Do not use arbitrary asynchronous setTimeout() calls to control gameplay state.

